Depends: ${misc:Depends}, choreonoid-corba
Description: Plugin for integrating Choreonoid with OpenRTM-aist 
 This plugin provides integration between Choreonoid and OpenRTM-aist.
 It enables users to build simulation systems in Choreonoid by combining
 RT-Components.
 The plugin provides functionality for launching RT-Components,
 a simulation execution context for OpenRTM-aist, and a system editor
 for configuring and managing component-based systems.
